WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.501
Forbrugeragenten: an agent on your side –

00:00:03.501 --> 00:00:07.191
for electricity, mobile and internet in Denmark.

00:00:08.041 --> 00:00:09.293
You confirm with MitID,

00:00:09.293 --> 00:00:11.907
so the agent can write to the providers for you.

00:00:15.161 --> 00:00:17.107
Agreements and bills in one place,

00:00:17.107 --> 00:00:19.799
and everything from the providers in one inbox.

00:00:20.661 --> 00:00:24.756
The agent writes to all the providers and brings offers home to you.

00:00:25.661 --> 00:00:29.570
It lines up the offers by price, terms and quality.

00:00:30.661 --> 00:00:33.876
You say yes. The app tells you when the offers are ready.

00:00:36.381 --> 00:00:39.050
Does your old power company owe you money?

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:41.465
Check for free, and ask for the money.

00:00:43.381 --> 00:00:45.768
Free, because the providers pay.

00:00:45.768 --> 00:00:48.603
Start your agent on iPhone or Android.
